WEBVTT

01:35.950 --> 01:40.850
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.550 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 34]

01:45.720 --> 01:46.100
[In Reverence, Song Cheng]

01:50.780 --> 01:52.830
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Li Hu]
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Chen San]

01:50.920 --> 01:52.220
The First Prince I knew

01:52.479 --> 01:53.940
was a loyal and righteous man.

01:52.850 --> 01:55.350
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Gu Yu]
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Hound]

01:54.070 --> 01:56.270
There's no way you'd ever plot treason.

01:56.560 --> 01:58.229
You must have been framed.

01:58.840 --> 02:00.370
So I secretly investigated

02:00.840 --> 02:01.480
and found

02:01.480 --> 02:03.010
the bodies of our brothers.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.710
I buried them quietly.

02:05.610 --> 02:07.790
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Gu Yu]
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Hound]

02:07.000 --> 02:09.030
Before we avenge them,

02:11.750 --> 02:12.630
we have to swallow

02:12.630 --> 02:14.290
all the tears and bitterness.

02:14.400 --> 02:16.470
Our brothers are
still watching us from above.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.280
Your Highness,

02:17.280 --> 02:18.540
leave Murong Jie to me.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.079
I swear

02:20.079 --> 02:21.810
I'll take his damn head myself!

02:24.630 --> 02:25.150
Good.

02:25.560 --> 02:27.400
The Murong father and son
framed Feng Suige.

02:27.400 --> 02:29.860
They won't spare
the Feng Battalion either.

02:30.430 --> 02:31.490
The Feng Battalion

02:31.680 --> 02:33.190
has already been controlled by Murong Yao.

02:33.190 --> 02:34.120
Impossible.

02:34.710 --> 02:36.590
Everyone in the Feng Battalion
has fought side by side with us.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.520
They'd never betray His Highness.

02:38.630 --> 02:40.890
Anyone who refused to yield to Murong Yao

02:40.960 --> 02:42.280
was killed by him.

02:44.400 --> 02:46.280
I pledged my loyalty to Your Highness

02:46.280 --> 02:47.870
and refused to serve under Murong Yao,

02:47.870 --> 02:48.680
so I

02:48.680 --> 02:49.560
retired early.

02:50.280 --> 02:51.680
Now I'm just a commoner.

02:52.590 --> 02:53.450
Your Highness,

02:53.800 --> 02:54.360
we've been

02:54.360 --> 02:55.420
searching for you.

02:57.120 --> 02:58.950
Such a huge upheaval in Susha

02:59.750 --> 03:01.480
must have raised suspicions.

03:01.630 --> 03:02.360
The entire court

03:02.360 --> 03:04.360
is controlled by the Murong family.

03:04.400 --> 03:06.190
No one dares to question this matter.

03:06.190 --> 03:08.110
However, during my investigation,

03:08.110 --> 03:08.710
I found someone

03:08.710 --> 03:10.310
secretly looking into this.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.280
It's Shen Wu,

03:12.810 --> 03:13.840
the Minister of Rites.

03:13.840 --> 03:16.020
Shen Wu is an opportunist.

03:16.590 --> 03:18.590
He definitely didn't want
to investigate it himself.

03:18.590 --> 03:20.650
Someone must be pulling his strings.

03:21.630 --> 03:22.910
The Murong father and son
and Empress Zhuang

03:22.910 --> 03:23.990
all know the truth.

03:24.470 --> 03:26.030
They're too busy concealing it

03:26.030 --> 03:26.960
to investigate.

03:27.190 --> 03:27.680
So,

03:28.400 --> 03:29.730
there's only one person

03:29.730 --> 03:30.960
with such power and the desire

03:30.960 --> 03:31.960
to know the truth.

03:34.590 --> 03:35.560
Chengyang.

03:36.430 --> 03:37.090
Song Cheng,

03:37.710 --> 03:38.910
I want to meet Shen Wu.

03:39.030 --> 03:39.890
Can you help me?

03:40.360 --> 03:41.020
No problem.

03:45.650 --> 03:47.620
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Li Hu]
[Memorial Tablet of My Friend, Chen San]

03:46.630 --> 03:47.430
Brothers,

03:50.000 --> 03:51.560
I swear

03:52.630 --> 03:54.829
I'll make them pay for blood with blood.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.630
Mother, you've come at a good time.

04:50.630 --> 04:52.010
The lamb chop from Susha

04:52.130 --> 04:53.590
is incredibly delicious.

04:54.870 --> 04:55.670
Everyone out!

04:56.360 --> 04:57.020
-Yes.
-Yes.

04:57.600 --> 04:58.120
Stop.

05:00.230 --> 05:02.160
Mother, just say what you want to say.

05:02.160 --> 05:03.820
If they dare to breathe a word,

05:03.830 --> 05:04.690
just kill them.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.850
I know why you've come, Mother.

05:14.040 --> 05:14.840
Bring it here.

05:34.850 --> 05:35.560
Mother, can you tell

05:35.560 --> 05:36.760
whose hamlet this is?

05:37.390 --> 05:38.390
It's Liang Pin's.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.060
How could you kill him?

05:43.080 --> 05:44.140
I am the Emperor.

05:44.600 --> 05:46.680
What's wrong with me killing Liang Pin?

05:46.680 --> 05:48.270
He was the Imperial Military Commander!

05:48.270 --> 05:49.200
What commander?

05:49.590 --> 05:51.010
Wasn't he just your dog?

05:51.800 --> 05:52.390
Mother,

05:52.560 --> 05:53.480
you tried to kill my woman.

05:53.480 --> 05:55.540
So what if I killed your dog in return?

05:58.830 --> 06:00.490
He was not even as good as a dog.

06:00.560 --> 06:01.490
Calling him that

06:01.950 --> 06:03.300
insults dogs.

06:05.040 --> 06:07.160
Princess Xiyang arrives!

06:20.920 --> 06:22.580
Greetings, Empress Dowager.

06:29.870 --> 06:30.430
Xiyang.

06:31.270 --> 06:31.720
Come.

06:41.220 --> 06:42.720
This is the lamb chop from Susha—

06:42.720 --> 06:43.720
quite delicious.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.650
I'll cut a piece for you myself.

06:45.650 --> 06:46.450
Your Majesty,

06:47.360 --> 06:49.220
why are you protecting this bitch

06:49.310 --> 06:50.180
like this?

06:50.390 --> 06:50.720
Here.

06:54.800 --> 06:55.800
How does it taste?

06:59.830 --> 07:01.070
It seems you're determined

07:01.070 --> 07:02.390
to go against me.

07:02.870 --> 07:03.510
Great.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.370
My Jingyan has grown up.

07:06.560 --> 07:08.090
You raised me well, Mother.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.220
How about this?

07:10.950 --> 07:12.410
Go enjoy your golden years

07:12.630 --> 07:14.290
and stay out of state affairs.

07:14.720 --> 07:15.730
I wouldn't dare.

07:17.390 --> 07:19.100
I'm afraid you'll ruin Jinxiu

07:19.270 --> 07:21.110
for this cheap Susha woman.

07:21.430 --> 07:23.560
Mother, you really care about Jinxiu.

07:26.770 --> 07:28.050
But this is my kingdom.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.240
I can ruin it however I want!

07:30.650 --> 07:32.190
You always say I'm incompetent,

07:32.190 --> 07:34.070
but that's because
you can't see my talent.

07:34.070 --> 07:34.930
What I'm good at

07:35.159 --> 07:36.490
isn't ruling a kingdom.

07:36.750 --> 07:37.950
It's destroying one.

07:40.820 --> 07:41.950
Liang Pin was the first

07:41.950 --> 07:43.370
to dare kill my woman.

07:43.950 --> 07:44.800
I hope

07:45.480 --> 07:47.200
he's the last.

07:51.310 --> 07:52.310
Empress Dowager,

07:52.750 --> 07:53.950
please have some tea.

08:16.870 --> 08:17.930
Mother, calm down.

08:19.120 --> 08:20.920
Please take care of your health.

08:36.549 --> 08:38.679
If you're truly a filial son,

08:39.440 --> 08:41.039
get rid of Feng Xiyang for me.

08:48.680 --> 08:50.740
Whether you're truly filial as a son,

08:51.000 --> 08:52.480
we'll see by what you do.

08:53.080 --> 08:54.890
I can't stand

08:55.000 --> 08:56.930
that bitch Feng Xiyang any longer.

09:03.790 --> 09:04.390
Mother,

09:04.870 --> 09:05.670
I understand.

09:22.240 --> 09:24.550
[Linfang Hall]

09:38.320 --> 09:40.030
Princess, you're here all alone.

09:40.030 --> 09:41.720
You must be troubled and have come here

09:41.720 --> 09:42.780
to clear your mind.

09:51.130 --> 09:51.960
Prince of Zhennan,

09:51.960 --> 09:53.160
you must hate my guts.

09:54.150 --> 09:55.240
All this concern

09:55.240 --> 09:56.270
and polite talk…

09:56.670 --> 09:58.130
what are you plotting now?

10:04.440 --> 10:05.570
Why would I hate you?

10:07.670 --> 10:09.070
There's no one else here.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.900
Why ask what you already know?

10:11.510 --> 10:13.310
Bai Shouzhuo died because of me.

10:14.030 --> 10:15.290
Shouldn't you hate me?

10:17.870 --> 10:19.910
Why do I see

10:20.820 --> 10:22.500
hostility in your eyes?

10:22.750 --> 10:24.610
The eyes see what the mind thinks.

10:24.960 --> 10:25.840
What's on your mind

10:25.840 --> 10:27.530
is what you see with your eyes.

10:28.480 --> 10:29.880
If you view me as an enemy,

10:30.000 --> 10:31.930
of course you'll sense hostility.

10:32.870 --> 10:34.070
You make a good point.

10:35.200 --> 10:35.960
But tell me,

10:35.960 --> 10:37.840
how have we ended up

10:38.240 --> 10:39.210
as enemies?

10:41.870 --> 10:42.850
You forgot?

10:43.510 --> 10:45.170
The first time we met,

10:45.750 --> 10:47.150
we were already enemies.

10:50.630 --> 10:52.160
Thank you for reminding me.

10:52.600 --> 10:53.230
Since

10:53.480 --> 10:55.480
we've been enemies all along,

10:57.720 --> 10:59.310
I feel much better.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.580
Are you here to kill me?

11:09.630 --> 11:10.120
Yes.

11:11.240 --> 11:13.040
Then why haven't you done it yet?

11:14.840 --> 11:17.530
Because I still owe you a favor.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.060
Someone like you

11:19.330 --> 11:20.860
actually cares about that?

11:21.320 --> 11:23.250
Because I'm hypocritical enough.

11:23.320 --> 11:24.240
That's actually

11:24.240 --> 11:25.960
the most honest thing I've heard from you.

11:25.960 --> 11:26.600
So,

11:26.670 --> 11:28.470
since I'm being honest for once,

11:28.960 --> 11:29.720
let me give you

11:29.720 --> 11:31.300
one last piece of advice.

11:35.300 --> 11:36.300
Leave this place.

11:37.130 --> 11:38.080
I can help you.

11:39.870 --> 11:40.750
Xia Jingshi,

11:42.390 --> 11:44.650
don't tell me
you want me to turn back now?

11:45.030 --> 11:45.890
Feng Xiyang,

11:47.030 --> 11:47.840
no one in this world

11:47.840 --> 11:49.150
understands what you're thinking

11:49.150 --> 11:50.450
better than I do.

11:50.840 --> 11:52.510
Because I've walked every step

11:52.510 --> 11:54.040
of the path you're walking.

11:54.960 --> 11:55.880
Your facade,

11:56.750 --> 11:57.610
your despair,

11:58.120 --> 12:00.920
and your desperate gamble—
I understand them all.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.710
After my father died,

12:03.750 --> 12:05.150
I just wanted to survive.

12:05.840 --> 12:08.200
Is it wrong for someone
to just want to live?

12:08.200 --> 12:09.080
But if I wanted to survive,

12:09.080 --> 12:11.210
I had to depend on the Empress Dowager—

12:11.510 --> 12:12.200
just like how you are

12:12.200 --> 12:13.460
using Xia Jingyan now.

12:14.960 --> 12:15.710
Eventually,

12:16.320 --> 12:17.670
driven by despair and revenge,

12:17.670 --> 12:19.330
you'll follow in my footsteps

12:19.840 --> 12:21.480
and become like me.

12:22.360 --> 12:24.020
I've never been a good person,

12:25.200 --> 12:25.800
but you are

12:26.750 --> 12:28.610
the kindest person I've ever met.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.870
Let go of all this.

12:31.150 --> 12:32.150
Let go of revenge.

12:32.150 --> 12:33.350
Live a peaceful life.

12:33.500 --> 12:34.740
It's not too late.

12:40.120 --> 12:41.200
Xia Jingshi,

12:43.200 --> 12:45.200
I've already fallen into the abyss,

12:46.110 --> 12:47.770
and only now do you offer help.

12:49.130 --> 12:50.730
I won't be grateful for this.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.870
I only find it even more disgusting!

12:54.240 --> 12:56.000
You might as well not help me at all.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.620
Just be the villain you are.

12:58.360 --> 12:59.550
You've made me what I am today,

12:59.550 --> 13:00.240
and now you want to save me?

13:00.240 --> 13:01.720
You think I'm pitiful, don't you?

13:01.720 --> 13:03.250
I don't need your sympathy!

13:03.600 --> 13:04.800
You don't deserve it!

13:09.550 --> 13:10.810
Since that's the case,

13:11.870 --> 13:12.680
so be it.

13:12.750 --> 13:13.750
Princess Xiyang,

13:14.470 --> 13:16.840
His Majesty said you've been gone
for a while picking flowers,

13:16.840 --> 13:18.370
so he sent me to check on you.

13:20.630 --> 13:21.760
An enemy is an enemy.

13:23.120 --> 13:25.380
Next time, don't pretend to be concerned

13:25.670 --> 13:27.200
or convince me to turn back.

13:28.350 --> 13:29.240
You just think killing me

13:29.240 --> 13:31.100
would interfere with your plans.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.130
Xia Jingshi,

13:35.750 --> 13:36.840
no one knows better than I do

13:36.840 --> 13:38.270
what's on your mind

13:39.480 --> 13:41.500
in this very moment.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.120
What's wrong with you?

14:10.480 --> 14:12.490
Do you still want this job?

14:26.960 --> 14:27.790
First Prince?

14:28.870 --> 14:29.210
You…

14:30.270 --> 14:31.400
you're still alive.

14:34.910 --> 14:36.010
I didn't see anything.

14:36.010 --> 14:37.120
I didn't see anything.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.810
I know nothing!

14:39.630 --> 14:40.800
You know nothing?

14:42.720 --> 14:44.720
Then there's no need for you to live.

14:45.870 --> 14:46.940
I'm still useful.

14:47.000 --> 14:48.380
I'm still useful!

14:49.910 --> 14:51.970
Your Highness, please don't kill me.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.600
What do you need me to do?

14:53.600 --> 14:55.390
I will do whatever you ask.

14:57.600 --> 14:59.630
[Personal Guards: Li Jianxin,
Zhao Yunhai, Zhang Moying]

14:58.390 --> 14:59.650
Just as you predicted,

14:59.960 --> 15:00.670
the Empress Dowager

15:00.670 --> 15:02.510
really did plant spies among Xia Jingyan's

15:02.510 --> 15:03.510
personal guards.

15:04.790 --> 15:06.080
That's just how she is.

15:07.150 --> 15:08.320
She has to

15:08.670 --> 15:09.240
have everything

15:09.240 --> 15:10.750
under her control.

15:11.790 --> 15:14.190
The Royal Guards
protect the imperial palace.

15:14.190 --> 15:16.320
Military Commander Liang Pin was her man.

15:16.320 --> 15:18.650
The personal guards protect Xia Jingyan.

15:18.790 --> 15:20.840
So naturally,
she has her people there too.

15:20.840 --> 15:22.700
She wants to control everything.

15:23.440 --> 15:25.770
Yet Your Highness has seen through it all.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.650
They're digging their own grave.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.720
Where did this list come from?

15:30.030 --> 15:31.490
Wang Encheng provided it.

15:31.840 --> 15:32.720
Among the personal guards,

15:32.720 --> 15:34.480
there's a team leader named Zhang Ming.

15:34.480 --> 15:36.320
He's close to Wang Encheng.

15:35.330 --> 15:38.480
[Personal Guards: Zhu Tieyi,
Chen Shuangjian, Zhong Jingsong]

15:36.750 --> 15:38.200
Zhang Ming told him in private

15:38.200 --> 15:40.000
that these particular personal guards

15:40.000 --> 15:41.080
had reported secretly

15:41.080 --> 15:42.810
to the Empress Dowager before.

15:44.240 --> 15:45.370
Does Zhang Ming know

15:46.120 --> 15:47.080
Wang Encheng is

15:47.120 --> 15:48.380
investigating for us?

15:48.960 --> 15:49.760
Rest assured.

15:50.270 --> 15:52.000
Wang Encheng is tight-lipped.

15:52.000 --> 15:54.400
He's never mentioned his connection to us.

15:55.360 --> 15:56.220
Your Highness,

15:56.600 --> 15:58.000
did you request this list

15:58.600 --> 15:59.310
because you

15:59.360 --> 16:00.510
already have a plan?

16:02.040 --> 16:03.800
This is a gift for Xia Jingyan.

16:04.840 --> 16:07.870
There's already a rift between Xia Jingyan
and the Empress Dowager,

16:07.870 --> 16:09.000
but they haven't

16:09.000 --> 16:10.530
completely fallen out yet.

16:11.120 --> 16:12.030
So I'm going to

16:12.030 --> 16:13.100
fan the flames.

16:15.670 --> 16:16.520
Find a way

16:16.840 --> 16:18.570
to get this list to Xia Jingyan.

16:18.910 --> 16:19.710
Just make sure

16:20.320 --> 16:21.390
no one realizes

16:21.390 --> 16:22.220
it's from us.

16:22.630 --> 16:23.080
Yes.

16:28.720 --> 16:29.690
What did you say?

16:30.150 --> 16:31.330
I really did

16:31.440 --> 16:32.970
meet with the First Prince.

16:33.360 --> 16:35.390
He wishes to meet with you in private.

16:35.390 --> 16:36.470
Given the urgency,

16:36.550 --> 16:37.360
I had no choice

16:37.360 --> 16:38.660
but to agree

16:38.720 --> 16:41.260
to relay the message to you first.

16:41.320 --> 16:43.000
Please forgive me.

16:47.440 --> 16:48.360
You did well.

16:49.790 --> 16:50.590
Your Majesty,

16:51.120 --> 16:53.210
are you going to meet him?

16:53.480 --> 16:54.080
Of course.

16:54.630 --> 16:55.490
Why wouldn't I?

16:58.440 --> 16:59.760
You're my confidant.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.540
Speak freely.

17:01.870 --> 17:04.589
Then, allow me to be frank.

17:04.880 --> 17:06.720
Prime Minister Zhuang died

17:06.720 --> 17:08.250
at the First Prince's hand.

17:08.349 --> 17:09.000
If that

17:09.000 --> 17:10.310
hadn't happened,

17:10.440 --> 17:11.440
the throne

17:12.200 --> 17:13.050
would have

17:13.829 --> 17:14.760
belonged to him.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.770
I've spoken out of turn.

17:19.790 --> 17:21.550
Please forgive me.

17:22.589 --> 17:24.250
You've only spoken the truth.

17:24.349 --> 17:25.550
There's nothing to forgive.

17:25.550 --> 17:26.000
Get up.

17:30.350 --> 17:31.320
But I believe

17:31.830 --> 17:32.430
Suige

17:32.470 --> 17:33.760
would never harm me.

17:34.270 --> 17:35.510
Go make arrangements immediately.

17:35.510 --> 17:36.710
I'll set out tonight.

17:37.270 --> 17:37.960
But you must

17:37.960 --> 17:39.030
not tell anyone.

17:39.490 --> 17:40.890
This must remain secret,

17:41.110 --> 17:42.640
especially from my mother.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.960
Yes, Your Majesty.

17:51.480 --> 17:52.470
Minister Shen.

17:53.830 --> 17:55.890
I've been watching you for some time.

17:56.070 --> 17:56.920
You met His Majesty

17:56.920 --> 17:58.450
in private again and again.

17:58.550 --> 18:00.010
You seem to be in a hurry.

18:00.200 --> 18:01.540
What is it about?

18:02.880 --> 18:05.340
Just official business.

18:11.750 --> 18:12.240
You understand

18:12.240 --> 18:13.470
which way the wind blows.

18:13.470 --> 18:14.860
Don't be misled into choosing

18:14.860 --> 18:15.720
the wrong side.

18:18.110 --> 18:19.440
I'm giving you one last chance

18:19.440 --> 18:20.760
to tell the truth.

18:23.550 --> 18:24.350
What?

18:24.920 --> 18:26.180
It's absolutely true.

18:26.510 --> 18:27.350
The men we placed

18:27.350 --> 18:29.080
among the personal guards

18:29.160 --> 18:31.560
were just executed by His Majesty's order.

18:32.510 --> 18:34.070
How did His Majesty discover them?

18:34.070 --> 18:35.810
I secretly looked into it.

18:36.480 --> 18:37.600
It's said that

18:37.750 --> 18:40.240
after His Majesty
killed Military Commander Liang,

18:40.240 --> 18:42.220
he searched his residence

18:42.550 --> 18:44.330
and found that list.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.350
Nonsense!

18:46.070 --> 18:48.350
Liang Pin had nothing
to do with the personal guards.

18:48.350 --> 18:49.400
How would he know?

18:50.720 --> 18:52.070
Liang Pin is now dead.

18:52.240 --> 18:53.500
Dead men tell no tales.

18:54.030 --> 18:55.350
No one will ever know

18:55.790 --> 18:57.590
where that list really came from.

18:57.590 --> 18:58.530
I doubt

18:59.200 --> 19:01.130
His Majesty had any real evidence,

19:01.400 --> 19:03.460
but he had them executed all the same.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.270
When does His Majesty

19:06.270 --> 19:08.200
ever need evidence to kill anyone?

19:09.880 --> 19:12.010
Summon the Prince of Zhennan to see me.

19:12.590 --> 19:13.240
Yes.

19:31.450 --> 19:33.090
[Yangyue Palace, Yuxiu Palace,
Hehuan Hall]

19:33.440 --> 19:35.170
Are you troubled by something?

19:35.830 --> 19:36.680
Come, come.

19:37.310 --> 19:38.550
I thought all you did was play around

19:38.550 --> 19:40.410
without a care for state affairs.

19:40.550 --> 19:41.000
But you're

19:41.000 --> 19:42.730
actually diligent sometimes.

19:45.640 --> 19:46.500
State affairs?

19:46.960 --> 19:48.000
What state affairs?

19:48.000 --> 19:48.590
If I had to

19:48.590 --> 19:50.200
handle state affairs myself,

19:50.200 --> 19:50.920
then what's the point

19:50.920 --> 19:52.650
of paying all those officials?

19:53.070 --> 19:53.510
Come.

19:54.790 --> 19:55.270
Sit.

19:57.310 --> 19:58.040
Look at this.

19:58.260 --> 19:59.420
[Jiyue Hall, Linhua Palace,
Pixiang Hall, Shuhua Palace]

19:58.440 --> 19:59.240
I ordered the palace staff

19:59.240 --> 20:00.590
to pick some new residences for you:

20:00.590 --> 20:03.120
Jiyue Hall, Linhua Palace,
and Pixiang Hall.

20:04.350 --> 20:05.750
I have no idea

20:05.750 --> 20:07.210
which one you'd prefer.

20:07.590 --> 20:08.450
How about this?

20:08.640 --> 20:09.500
You take a look.

20:09.590 --> 20:11.120
Choose whichever you like.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.510
So this is what you were studying?

20:13.510 --> 20:14.110
Yes.

20:14.720 --> 20:15.850
If you like them all,

20:16.070 --> 20:17.160
I'll give them all to you.

20:17.160 --> 20:18.200
I guess a few

20:18.200 --> 20:18.920
pedantic old officials

20:18.920 --> 20:19.920
will object.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.090
But don't worry.

20:21.440 --> 20:22.440
Whoever dares to object,

20:22.440 --> 20:23.590
I'll have them beheaded.

20:23.590 --> 20:25.190
I don't need a new residence.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.100
I can just stay in the Mirror Room.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.590
The Mirror Room is too shabby.

20:29.590 --> 20:30.790
Just a place to sleep!

20:31.270 --> 20:32.000
If you ask me,

20:32.000 --> 20:33.000
the Mirror Room is no different

20:33.000 --> 20:34.330
from all these palaces.

20:37.030 --> 20:38.070
Feng Xiyang!

20:38.880 --> 20:39.680
I have so many palaces,

20:39.680 --> 20:41.340
and you don't like any of them?

20:42.240 --> 20:44.500
If you continue to be so unappreciative…

20:47.530 --> 20:48.750
I'll build you a new palace.

20:48.750 --> 20:49.610
How about that?

20:50.680 --> 20:51.420
Xia Jingyan,

20:51.880 --> 20:53.680
instead of thinking about these things,

20:53.680 --> 20:54.350
why don't you help me figure out

20:54.350 --> 20:56.410
how to kill the Murong father and son?

20:57.160 --> 20:58.090
What's the rush?

20:58.640 --> 21:00.240
Once they're killed

21:00.400 --> 21:01.590
and you get your revenge,

21:01.590 --> 21:02.820
you'll want to leave.

21:04.680 --> 21:06.410
You want to go back on your word?

21:06.680 --> 21:07.720
You're the ruler of a kingdom.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.640
A king's word is law.

21:08.640 --> 21:10.570
You can't break your promise to me!

21:10.830 --> 21:12.340
I am a ruler, that's true,

21:12.400 --> 21:13.570
but I'm also a man.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.570
Isn't it normal for a man

21:15.790 --> 21:16.680
to lie to a woman?

21:16.680 --> 21:17.200
You…

21:20.170 --> 21:20.920
Wait, wait.

21:22.070 --> 21:23.000
Don't get upset.

21:23.240 --> 21:24.700
I was just joking with you.

21:25.310 --> 21:26.240
Alright.

21:26.880 --> 21:28.270
I never lie to women,

21:28.550 --> 21:29.810
especially not to you.

21:30.070 --> 21:31.530
It was you who used that...

21:31.790 --> 21:32.510
that bet

21:32.510 --> 21:34.160
to stop me from attacking Susha.

21:34.160 --> 21:35.350
You have to give me some time

21:35.350 --> 21:36.680
to come up with a new plan

21:36.790 --> 21:38.650
to kill the Murong father and son.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.200
Alright. Be patient.

21:40.200 --> 21:41.780
You just want me to stay.

21:41.880 --> 21:42.720
You want this imperial palace

21:42.720 --> 21:43.800
to become my cage!

21:44.110 --> 21:44.720
Your cage?

21:46.440 --> 21:47.440
What a great idea!

21:47.590 --> 21:49.050
Why didn't I think of that?

21:49.200 --> 21:49.680
I'll immediately

21:49.680 --> 21:50.640
build you a new palace

21:50.640 --> 21:51.550
that looks like a cage!

21:51.550 --> 21:52.280
You're sick!

21:53.440 --> 21:54.310
Don't go yet!

21:54.640 --> 21:55.830
I have a gift for you.

22:00.290 --> 22:01.950
[Fuxin Pavilion]

22:05.790 --> 22:08.050
I asked you to kill the Princess of Susha,

22:08.200 --> 22:09.860
yet you still haven't done it.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.390
You've really let me down.

22:12.270 --> 22:13.400
Forgive me, Mother.

22:14.830 --> 22:16.040
His Majesty has

22:16.350 --> 22:17.400
assigned personal guards

22:17.400 --> 22:18.260
to protect her.

22:19.070 --> 22:21.000
I really haven't found the chance.

22:21.030 --> 22:21.820
Mother,

22:22.360 --> 22:24.610
could you temporarily

22:24.960 --> 22:26.820
remove the personal guards

22:27.270 --> 22:28.110
so that I can…

22:28.110 --> 22:30.100
I only gave you this one task,

22:30.550 --> 22:32.350
and you still need my help?

22:36.510 --> 22:37.570
Calm down, Mother.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.420
Forgive my incompetence.

22:41.510 --> 22:42.200
Forget it.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.960
You have the will but lack the means.

22:45.000 --> 22:45.640
After all, this is

22:45.640 --> 22:46.970
not your Pingling City.

22:49.440 --> 22:51.100
It's Mother's Pingling City.

22:51.550 --> 22:53.010
I was away for so many years

22:53.480 --> 22:55.240
guarding Pingling for you.

22:56.240 --> 22:58.770
All land under heaven
belongs to the Emperor.

22:59.200 --> 23:01.130
It's His Majesty's Pingling City.

23:01.510 --> 23:03.240
You weren't guarding it for me.

23:03.720 --> 23:05.070
Don't say such foolish words

23:05.070 --> 23:06.110
ever again.

23:07.480 --> 23:08.110
Get up.

23:13.830 --> 23:15.000
His Majesty has become

23:15.000 --> 23:16.750
increasingly difficult to understand.

23:16.750 --> 23:18.880
Officials proposed attacking Susha,

23:18.920 --> 23:20.200
but he refused.

23:20.680 --> 23:22.680
It must be Feng Xiyang interfering.

23:23.310 --> 23:25.030
I planned to restore

23:25.030 --> 23:26.360
your military command,

23:26.830 --> 23:28.630
but it keeps getting postponed.

23:28.830 --> 23:30.560
After all these years outside,

23:31.350 --> 23:32.200
being able to return

23:32.200 --> 23:34.130
and serve you with filial devotion

23:34.240 --> 23:35.750
isn't such a bad thing.

23:36.790 --> 23:38.590
Rather than a filial son,

23:39.200 --> 23:40.400
what I truly need

23:40.400 --> 23:42.930
is the Prince of Zhennan
who lets me rest easy.

23:44.350 --> 23:46.000
Mother, you mean...

23:48.200 --> 23:48.880
You fool,

23:49.680 --> 23:52.140
you're in real danger
without realizing it.

23:52.440 --> 23:54.110
His Majesty has always wanted you dead.

23:54.110 --> 23:55.970
In the past, I could hold him back,

23:56.550 --> 23:57.240
but now,

23:57.270 --> 23:59.470
with Feng Xiyang messing with his mind,

23:59.750 --> 24:00.400
he barely even

24:00.400 --> 24:02.130
acknowledges me as his mother.

24:02.310 --> 24:04.110
If he ever insists on killing you,

24:04.110 --> 24:05.640
I may not be able to stop him.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.900
Please enlighten me, Mother.

24:08.070 --> 24:09.720
How can I protect myself?

24:10.850 --> 24:13.200
Right now,
with peace between the two kingdoms,

24:13.200 --> 24:14.660
he thinks you're useless.

24:15.640 --> 24:18.100
But when war breaks out,
it'll be different.

24:18.200 --> 24:20.350
That's why Feng Xiyang must die,

24:20.440 --> 24:22.030
and Susa must be attacked.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.160
However, I don't want

24:24.160 --> 24:25.030
this matter

24:25.590 --> 24:27.990
to create a rift
between His Majesty and me.

24:28.310 --> 24:29.110
I understand.

24:30.400 --> 24:32.350
I'll first kill Feng Xiyang

24:32.590 --> 24:33.920
and frame Susha for it.

24:34.400 --> 24:35.510
Then I'll provoke His Majesty

24:35.510 --> 24:37.240
into waging war against Susha.

24:39.030 --> 24:40.270
Since I can't go after

24:40.590 --> 24:42.070
Feng Xiyang in the palace,

24:42.920 --> 24:43.780
I might as well…

24:46.550 --> 24:48.030
try something outside.

24:48.960 --> 24:49.590
How could His Majesty

24:49.590 --> 24:51.480
possibly let her leave the palace?

24:51.480 --> 24:53.280
The opportunity will come soon.

24:54.550 --> 24:55.110
Mother,

24:57.200 --> 24:59.330
the Qianqiu Festival is approaching.

25:20.240 --> 25:22.100
Will your brother stand with you?

25:24.460 --> 25:25.480
Chengyang and I

25:25.960 --> 25:28.220
may not be brothers from the same mother,

25:28.440 --> 25:29.350
but I watched him grow up

25:29.350 --> 25:30.590
all these years.

25:31.440 --> 25:32.150
I've always treated him

25:32.150 --> 25:33.690
like my own brother.

25:34.350 --> 25:35.940
I know his character well.

25:36.640 --> 25:38.570
He might be completely in the dark,

25:38.720 --> 25:40.030
unaware of the truth,

25:40.440 --> 25:42.550
believing what his mother has told him.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.200
No matter

25:43.200 --> 25:44.750
what Empress Zhuang told him,

25:44.750 --> 25:46.470
it must be full of loopholes.

25:46.880 --> 25:47.920
In such a just world,

25:47.920 --> 25:50.050
no one can truly turn black into white.

25:51.030 --> 25:53.090
Chengyang can tell right from wrong.

25:53.240 --> 25:54.030
I trust him.

25:55.640 --> 25:57.680
Although I've never met Feng Chengyang,

25:57.680 --> 25:59.440
after hearing what you've said,

25:59.440 --> 26:00.070
he sounds like

26:00.070 --> 26:01.270
a reasonable person.

26:01.740 --> 26:03.670
To maintain a kind heart,

26:04.000 --> 26:06.000
even with blood ties to the Zhuangs—

26:06.310 --> 26:07.640
that's really not easy.

26:09.270 --> 26:10.640
I was worried

26:10.680 --> 26:12.940
that you brothers would become enemies.

26:13.000 --> 26:14.000
So many royal siblings

26:14.000 --> 26:15.200
like you would fight

26:16.030 --> 26:16.960
to the bitter end

26:17.030 --> 26:18.300
for the throne.

26:18.960 --> 26:19.820
Surprisingly,

26:20.110 --> 26:21.980
you two are the opposite.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.540
That's truly rare.

26:24.310 --> 26:26.030
If it weren't for the throne,

26:27.500 --> 26:28.750
my buddies like Gu Yu

26:29.240 --> 26:31.100
wouldn't have ended up like that.

26:36.030 --> 26:38.230
You are the most important person to me.

26:39.200 --> 26:40.260
After everything,

26:41.110 --> 26:42.570
I still have you by my side,

26:43.000 --> 26:45.240
and Lu Ke, Yun Fang, and Yun Qing,

26:45.510 --> 26:46.590
who are not blood relatives

26:46.590 --> 26:47.920
but are more than family,

26:47.920 --> 26:48.590
by my side.

26:49.480 --> 26:50.940
I'm already very content.

27:02.200 --> 27:03.060
I didn't expect

27:04.200 --> 27:05.310
His Highness to suffer so much

27:05.310 --> 27:06.570
in the Storm Alliance.

27:07.030 --> 27:08.030
Thankfully, Miss Yixiao was

27:08.030 --> 27:09.490
by his side through it all,

27:09.550 --> 27:10.240
pulling His Highness

27:10.240 --> 27:11.840
back from the brink of death.

27:11.960 --> 27:13.420
Let's not talk about that.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.070
How are you?

27:16.110 --> 27:17.510
Let me see if it's healed.

27:18.220 --> 27:19.830
Just superficial wounds.
They're all healed.

27:19.830 --> 27:20.440
Don't bother.

27:20.440 --> 27:21.640
Why are you acting shy like a girl?

27:21.640 --> 27:22.550
Just let me check.

27:22.550 --> 27:23.590
What's wrong with you?

27:23.590 --> 27:24.790
You wanna fight?

27:25.200 --> 27:25.920
Never mind.

27:26.440 --> 27:27.110
I won't fight you.

27:27.110 --> 27:28.270
You're still recovering

27:28.270 --> 27:29.200
from your injuries.

27:29.200 --> 27:30.080
If I beat you,

27:30.200 --> 27:31.590
it wouldn't be honorable.

27:31.590 --> 27:32.750
You beat me?

27:33.510 --> 27:34.790
Have you ever beaten me?

27:34.790 --> 27:36.650
Have I ever fought you seriously?

27:37.920 --> 27:39.550
Didn't I kill

27:39.550 --> 27:40.310
20 more enemies than you

27:40.310 --> 27:41.030
on the battlefield?

27:41.030 --> 27:42.750
Fine, fine.

27:42.750 --> 27:44.010
You're the best, okay?

27:44.750 --> 27:45.550
Just you wait.

27:46.030 --> 27:46.790
After I avenge His Highness

27:46.790 --> 27:48.120
by killing the Murongs,

27:48.350 --> 27:49.160
we can

27:49.160 --> 27:50.290
have a proper match.

27:50.920 --> 27:51.510
I'll always be

27:51.510 --> 27:52.880
one step ahead of you on the battlefield.

27:52.880 --> 27:53.480
Fine.

27:54.200 --> 27:55.090
I'd like to see

27:55.350 --> 27:57.080
who will really come out on top.

27:57.110 --> 27:57.960
It's a deal then.

27:57.960 --> 27:58.620
It's a deal.

28:09.480 --> 28:11.720
This is a bow
with a draw weight of over two piculs.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.350
Yes.

28:12.920 --> 28:14.680
I thought Your Highness had died

28:14.680 --> 28:15.680
and planned to assassinate the Murongs

28:15.680 --> 28:16.730
to avenge you.

28:17.110 --> 28:17.750
But they always have

28:17.750 --> 28:19.070
guards protecting them.

28:19.070 --> 28:20.350
I can only shoot

28:20.350 --> 28:21.480
from 150 paces away.

28:22.790 --> 28:23.860
At that distance,

28:24.310 --> 28:26.170
you can hit six or seven out of ten.

28:27.310 --> 28:28.830
They're both military commanders.

28:28.830 --> 28:30.630
They wear armor when they go out.

28:30.640 --> 28:31.680
From 150 paces away,

28:31.680 --> 28:33.200
a kill shot is extremely difficult.

28:33.200 --> 28:35.130
At best, you could hit a vital spot.

28:35.270 --> 28:36.590
But regular bows and arrows

28:36.590 --> 28:37.750
can't penetrate armor

28:37.750 --> 28:38.890
even if you hit,

28:39.350 --> 28:40.110
so you have to use

28:40.110 --> 28:41.830
a heavy-tipped arrow and a strong bow.

28:41.830 --> 28:42.350
Yes.

28:43.030 --> 28:43.830
A few days ago,

28:43.880 --> 28:45.210
I secretly got this bow.

28:45.350 --> 28:46.240
If my brother found out,

28:46.240 --> 28:47.880
he'd stop me from taking risks,

28:47.880 --> 28:49.480
so I kept it stashed outside.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.240
However, I've only

28:50.240 --> 28:51.700
ever used a two-picul bow,

28:51.830 --> 28:52.960
so I can't guarantee

28:52.960 --> 28:54.350
a kill shot with this one.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.070
I can try it.

28:55.310 --> 28:56.750
The Moon-Shooting Bow I used before

28:56.750 --> 28:58.000
had a draw weight of over two piculs.

28:58.000 --> 28:58.480
No.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.140
Lord Ling said

29:01.510 --> 29:02.920
you can't draw a strong bow.

29:02.920 --> 29:04.520
I've completely recovered.

29:05.200 --> 29:05.790
Look.

29:10.110 --> 29:10.710
Yixiao.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.390
With this bow,

29:12.550 --> 29:13.880
I can lend you a hand

29:14.160 --> 29:15.790
and help you deal with the Murongs.

29:15.790 --> 29:17.270
But if you hurt yourself again

29:17.270 --> 29:18.640
just to kill them,

29:18.880 --> 29:20.270
it's simply not worth it.

29:20.270 --> 29:21.150
Don't worry,

29:21.270 --> 29:22.240
I know my limits.

29:22.830 --> 29:23.630
Don't forget,

29:24.110 --> 29:25.440
I'm Fu Yixiao after all.

29:32.680 --> 29:33.540
Mind your step.

29:43.000 --> 29:43.960
Someone's coming.

29:43.960 --> 29:44.480
These are

29:44.480 --> 29:45.610
Song's scout bells.

29:45.720 --> 29:46.920
Once someone gets near this area,

29:46.920 --> 29:47.890
the bells will be

29:47.960 --> 29:49.020
triggered to ring.

29:51.030 --> 29:51.640
Your Highness,

29:51.640 --> 29:52.510
someone is coming this way

29:52.510 --> 29:53.270
with guards.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.370
It's Chengyang.

30:03.830 --> 30:05.290
Greetings, Your Majesty.

30:12.310 --> 30:13.030
Your Majesty,

30:13.030 --> 30:14.310
I'll wait outside

30:14.400 --> 30:15.240
for you.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.240
Who are you?

30:53.830 --> 30:56.030
Your brother is waiting for you inside.

31:33.390 --> 31:34.390
Let me see

31:36.200 --> 31:37.720
what Chengyang looks like

31:38.240 --> 31:39.200
as an emperor.

31:40.070 --> 31:40.680
Suige,

31:41.800 --> 31:43.040
it's so wonderful

31:43.550 --> 31:44.480
to see you again.

31:44.830 --> 31:46.360
You also thought I was dead?

31:48.030 --> 31:49.550
In the past, every time you returned

31:49.550 --> 31:50.880
from a victorious campaign,

31:50.880 --> 31:52.210
I'd go welcome you back.

31:52.750 --> 31:54.590
Once, you didn't come back with the army.

31:54.590 --> 31:56.190
They said you died in battle.

31:56.200 --> 31:57.240
I was devastated.

31:58.350 --> 31:59.400
Later, I told you

31:59.920 --> 32:01.600
that unless you saw my body,

32:01.750 --> 32:03.010
you shouldn't believe

32:03.030 --> 32:04.360
any rumors from anyone.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.840
Because your brother

32:06.030 --> 32:07.630
is the invincible God of War.

32:09.640 --> 32:10.500
Murong Yao said

32:10.790 --> 32:12.270
your body was left in the wilderness

32:12.270 --> 32:13.530
and couldn't be found.

32:13.720 --> 32:15.400
I didn't see it with my own eyes,

32:15.400 --> 32:16.660
so I didn't believe it.

32:18.200 --> 32:18.720
Come.

32:19.310 --> 32:19.880
Sit.

32:29.240 --> 32:29.880
Brother,

32:30.880 --> 32:31.670
actually,

32:32.240 --> 32:33.570
ascending to the throne

32:34.110 --> 32:34.970
was not my wish.

32:35.310 --> 32:35.960
I know.

32:36.720 --> 32:37.480
I already learned about

32:37.480 --> 32:38.440
what happened between you

32:38.440 --> 32:40.040
and Grandfather in the past.

32:40.070 --> 32:40.590
Suige,

32:41.680 --> 32:43.130
why didn't you tell me?

32:43.750 --> 32:45.790
Telling you would only have worried you

32:45.790 --> 32:46.640
needlessly.

32:47.680 --> 32:49.310
There's a perpetrator for every injustice.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.880
None of this should have come

32:50.880 --> 32:52.440
between us brothers.

32:53.050 --> 32:54.310
Why trouble yourself?

32:58.070 --> 32:58.730
Chengyang,

32:59.720 --> 33:00.270
I've heard

33:00.270 --> 33:01.880
you've been secretly investigating

33:01.880 --> 33:03.510
the truth behind Father's assassination.

33:03.510 --> 33:05.840
The fact
that you came to see me today means

33:06.200 --> 33:06.750
that you still

33:06.750 --> 33:08.410
care about me as your brother.

33:08.750 --> 33:09.350
Brother,

33:10.550 --> 33:12.110
how did Father really die?

33:13.200 --> 33:14.640
And who set you up?

33:16.100 --> 33:17.560
The Murong father and son.

33:19.280 --> 33:20.680
They forged an imperial edict

33:20.680 --> 33:22.140
to lure me into the palace.

33:24.070 --> 33:25.400
By the time I saw Father,

33:26.440 --> 33:27.970
he had already passed away.

33:32.430 --> 33:33.690
Who else was involved?

33:34.750 --> 33:35.880
An event this big…

33:36.750 --> 33:38.030
I don't believe the Murongs did it

33:38.030 --> 33:39.400
all on their own.

33:40.400 --> 33:41.680
You're asking me this…

33:44.960 --> 33:45.790
because you already

33:45.790 --> 33:47.050
have an answer, right?

33:47.790 --> 33:48.440
Brother,

33:51.640 --> 33:53.570
I want to hear it from you directly.

33:54.720 --> 33:55.980
Was my mother involved

33:57.640 --> 33:59.480
in the attempt to murder you?

34:11.550 --> 34:12.480
I have no proof,

34:14.670 --> 34:16.840
but she must have been involved.

34:18.880 --> 34:19.630
Chengyang,

34:20.710 --> 34:21.969
I called you here today

34:22.510 --> 34:23.030
because I hope

34:23.030 --> 34:25.000
you can prepare yourself in advance.

34:25.000 --> 34:26.840
And I hope you can understand me.

34:28.550 --> 34:30.080
Because what I'm about to do

34:30.800 --> 34:32.929
is to kill my enemies with my own hands.

34:34.550 --> 34:35.230
Brother,

34:36.630 --> 34:38.290
I'll return the throne to you.

34:38.590 --> 34:40.480
But may I ask you one thing?

34:41.800 --> 34:42.730
Spare my mother.

34:44.030 --> 34:45.760
I will take her away from Yujing

34:45.800 --> 34:46.929
and never come back.

34:48.400 --> 34:49.460
I'm the only family

34:50.400 --> 34:51.880
my mother has now.

34:54.760 --> 34:57.110
All her mistakes were for my sake.

34:57.840 --> 35:00.320
Her sins are my sins.

35:02.030 --> 35:03.560
Let me pay the price for her.

35:03.920 --> 35:05.320
What have you done wrong?

35:08.840 --> 35:09.590
You and I are merely

35:09.590 --> 35:10.990
pawns of circumstances.

35:21.710 --> 35:22.370
Chengyang.

35:28.400 --> 35:29.550
I promise you:

35:31.710 --> 35:33.400
I will not kill your mother.

35:39.070 --> 35:40.130
Qianqiu Festival?

35:41.230 --> 35:43.230
Xia Jingyan's Daily Chronicle says

35:43.670 --> 35:45.280
that every year at the Qianqiu Festival,

35:45.280 --> 35:47.920
he leaves the palace
to visit his ancestral home.

35:47.920 --> 35:49.120
If we want to kill him,

35:49.510 --> 35:50.840
that's the best chance.

35:51.670 --> 35:52.590
But for such occasions,

35:52.590 --> 35:54.050
security is always tight.

35:54.480 --> 35:55.960
There will be countless guards
protecting him,

35:55.960 --> 35:57.420
both openly and secretly.

35:57.510 --> 35:59.960
That's why we need
to use the Empress Dowager.

35:59.960 --> 36:01.670
When Xia Jingyan leaves the palace,

36:01.670 --> 36:04.060
he'll certainly bring
Feng Xiyang with him.

36:04.060 --> 36:05.000
No one wants Feng Xiyang dead

36:05.000 --> 36:06.730
more than the Empress Dowager.

36:07.000 --> 36:08.030
She will secretly

36:08.510 --> 36:09.960
help us reassign most of

36:09.960 --> 36:11.320
Xia Jingyan's guards.

36:12.110 --> 36:13.170
If that's the case,

36:13.670 --> 36:14.590
our chances of success

36:14.590 --> 36:15.790
will be much greater.

36:16.190 --> 36:17.840
But will the Empress Dowager agree?

36:17.840 --> 36:19.070
She definitely will.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.440
She's eager

36:21.440 --> 36:23.760
to provoke a war between the two kingdoms.

36:23.760 --> 36:24.480
Only then

36:24.960 --> 36:27.290
will Xia Jingyan
need to rely on her again.

36:30.320 --> 36:31.980
We need to prepare in advance.

36:32.430 --> 36:34.480
It's time to send word to Pingling City

36:34.480 --> 36:35.810
and call in more people.

36:36.110 --> 36:36.840
Understood.

36:39.880 --> 36:40.940
What are you doing?

36:41.960 --> 36:42.710
Prince of Zhennan,

36:42.710 --> 36:44.110
His Majesty summons you.

37:03.320 --> 37:04.120
You're angry?

37:07.650 --> 37:08.510
Who's the fool

37:08.510 --> 37:09.910
that upset Her Highness?

37:16.510 --> 37:18.040
It couldn't be me, could it?

37:20.190 --> 37:21.510
Why would I be angry?

37:22.510 --> 37:23.240
Xia Jingyan,

37:23.510 --> 37:24.440
don't think I can't

37:24.440 --> 37:25.900
take revenge without you.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.430
Interesting.

37:28.510 --> 37:29.480
Then tell me,

37:29.480 --> 37:30.110
what's your plan?

37:30.110 --> 37:30.590
Did you

37:30.590 --> 37:31.990
just come here to mock me?

37:37.960 --> 37:39.070
I came to help you.

37:39.550 --> 37:40.070
Get out.

37:42.030 --> 37:43.630
The more ungrateful you are,

37:43.920 --> 37:44.980
the more I like you.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.090
Bring him in!

37:54.710 --> 37:56.200
Why did you bring him here?

37:56.550 --> 37:57.810
I don't want to see him!

38:06.000 --> 38:07.460
Greetings, Your Majesty.

38:07.480 --> 38:08.400
May I ask why

38:08.590 --> 38:09.720
you've summoned me?

38:12.710 --> 38:14.340
You tried to kill my woman,

38:14.760 --> 38:17.160
and you still don't know
why I summoned you?

38:20.100 --> 38:21.830
Your Majesty, what do you mean?

38:22.320 --> 38:23.450
I don't understand.

38:25.550 --> 38:27.400
You forgot quite quickly.

38:27.810 --> 38:29.070
Why did you

38:29.880 --> 38:31.080
go to the Flower Hall?

38:31.320 --> 38:32.400
You've been visiting

38:32.400 --> 38:34.260
the Empress Dowager repeatedly.

38:34.320 --> 38:34.880
What task did

38:34.880 --> 38:35.760
she assign you?

38:36.480 --> 38:37.810
The same as Liang Pin's?

38:37.920 --> 38:38.580
To kill her?

38:43.440 --> 38:44.280
I was merely paying

38:44.280 --> 38:46.740
my regular respects
to the Empress Dowager.

38:47.360 --> 38:48.560
Still won't admit it?

38:49.030 --> 38:49.550
Good.

38:50.230 --> 38:52.280
You pay your respects more often
than I do.

38:52.280 --> 38:53.140
You're filial.

38:53.320 --> 38:54.000
I'm not.

38:54.670 --> 38:55.870
Is that what you mean?

38:55.920 --> 38:56.840
You misunderstand.

38:56.840 --> 38:57.590
Then what were you doing

38:57.590 --> 38:58.650
at the Flower Hall?

38:58.840 --> 39:01.040
Were you perhaps rekindling a romance?

39:04.550 --> 39:05.110
I...

39:05.190 --> 39:06.880
Think carefully about your answer.

39:06.880 --> 39:07.960
If you were rekindling a romance

39:07.960 --> 39:08.760
with my woman,

39:08.760 --> 39:10.090
I'd be very displeased.

39:10.230 --> 39:11.210
If not,

39:11.440 --> 39:13.040
I'd be even more displeased.

39:13.220 --> 39:15.220
You don't find my woman attractive?

39:21.670 --> 39:22.940
If I'm displeased,

39:23.210 --> 39:24.670
someone's head will roll.

39:26.160 --> 39:26.830
Tell me.

39:27.150 --> 39:28.150
Tell me, why did you go to her?

39:28.150 --> 39:29.750
Was it to rekindle a romance?

39:30.570 --> 39:32.420
If you want me dead, Your Majesty,

39:32.420 --> 39:34.280
why bother with finding excuses?

39:36.370 --> 39:37.710
Who do you think you are?

39:39.200 --> 39:40.860
Do I need an excuse to kill you?

39:41.800 --> 39:42.360
At the Flower Hall,

39:42.360 --> 39:43.960
I had something to say to him.

39:50.630 --> 39:52.710
Prince of Zhennan, have you forgotten?

39:52.710 --> 39:55.310
I was the one who stopped you
at the Flower Hall.

39:55.360 --> 39:56.930
I asked if you had ever,

39:57.550 --> 39:58.320
even for a moment,

39:58.320 --> 39:59.880
imagined growing old with me.

39:59.880 --> 40:00.280
I...

40:01.550 --> 40:01.960
You...

40:02.440 --> 40:03.840
You were rekindling a romance with him?

40:03.840 --> 40:05.070
Don't say that again!

40:05.360 --> 40:06.480
He and I broke ties long ago.

40:06.480 --> 40:07.610
There's no romance!

40:08.400 --> 40:09.070
I just

40:09.070 --> 40:10.620
wanted an answer.

40:11.360 --> 40:12.560
What was your answer?

40:18.440 --> 40:19.190
Never.

40:20.080 --> 40:21.900
♪ Roaming freely ♪

40:22.240 --> 40:25.500
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

40:25.920 --> 40:26.550
I see.

40:27.480 --> 40:29.390
♪ The wet wings ♪

40:29.660 --> 40:33.020
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

40:36.840 --> 40:37.360
You crazy woman,

40:36.890 --> 40:40.570
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

40:37.360 --> 40:38.070
are you serious?

40:38.070 --> 40:39.190
Xia Jingyan, I've told you,

40:39.190 --> 40:39.840
I can still get my revenge

40:39.840 --> 40:41.230
without you!

40:41.280 --> 40:42.220
Let go of me!

40:42.280 --> 40:43.070
Let me kill him!

40:43.070 --> 40:44.190
-Take him away! Now!
-Let me kill him!

40:43.100 --> 40:47.920
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

40:45.590 --> 40:46.660
Xia Jingshi,

40:46.710 --> 40:47.800
I'll kill you!

40:50.440 --> 40:51.400
Listen to me!

40:52.280 --> 40:53.340
You're from Susha.

40:53.440 --> 40:54.320
If you kill him,

40:54.630 --> 40:56.070
his followers won't let you go,

40:56.070 --> 40:57.320
nor will the people of Jinxiu!

40:57.320 --> 40:58.330
Then why did you

40:58.440 --> 40:59.500
bring him to see me?

40:59.630 --> 41:00.800
I just wanted to humiliate him

41:00.800 --> 41:02.590
and scare him a bit
to make you feel better!

41:02.590 --> 41:03.390
Xia Jingyan,

41:03.590 --> 41:04.480
remember this:

41:04.760 --> 41:05.320
I was

41:05.320 --> 41:06.920
never joking about revenge.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.920
If you dare toy with me again,

41:09.400 --> 41:10.590
I won't let you off!

41:13.880 --> 41:14.800
You crazy woman.

41:14.800 --> 41:15.730
What did you say?

41:16.670 --> 41:17.870
I said I'll remember!

41:46.990 --> 41:48.450
You've seen your brother,

41:48.760 --> 41:50.490
but why are you even more upset?

41:52.360 --> 41:53.560
He came to see me today

41:54.110 --> 41:56.240
because he cares for me as his brother.

41:56.710 --> 41:58.400
But I told him terrible news.

41:59.110 --> 42:01.310
Chengyang has already lost his father.

42:01.400 --> 42:02.190
How will he face

42:02.190 --> 42:03.670
his mother from now on?

42:08.760 --> 42:10.290
Usually at times like this,

42:10.960 --> 42:11.800
wouldn't you offer me

42:11.800 --> 42:12.800
words of comfort?

42:13.880 --> 42:15.480
Why are you silent this time?

42:15.630 --> 42:16.760
I was just thinking:

42:17.710 --> 42:18.670
how can there be someone

42:18.670 --> 42:20.200
as kind as you in this world?

42:20.630 --> 42:21.440
His mother

42:21.440 --> 42:23.170
caused you to lose your mother,

42:23.480 --> 42:25.210
yet you're still worried about

42:25.440 --> 42:26.070
how he will

42:26.070 --> 42:27.530
get along with his mother.

42:31.480 --> 42:33.210
After all you've been through,

42:33.440 --> 42:34.400
I'm really glad

42:34.840 --> 42:36.480
you still have a younger brother
like Chengyang.
